OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil tax could increase to
OL,4,Aretain city statuses
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in parts of south-east England
OL,7,Fmay have to pay up to #20 more a year
OL,8,Fin council tax for the city they live
OL,9,Fin to retain city status and to use its
OL,10,Fcoat of arms, ahead of the Local
OL,11,FGovernment Reorganisation.
OL,13,FThe potentially affected cities are
OL,14,FCanterbury in Kent, Chichester in West
OL,15,FSussex and Brighton & Hove in East
OL,16,FSussex.
OL,18,FUnder the reorganisation plans,
OL,19,FCanterbury City Council is to be
OL,20,Freplaced by a new East Kent authority
OL,21,Ffrom 2028.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
