OL,3,GNEWSACouncil tax could increase to
OL,4,Aretain city statuses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ministry of Housing, Communities and
OL,7,FLocal Government spokesperson said: "We
OL,8,Frecognise the pride, history and
OL,9,Fidentity that sits behind our cities,
OL,10,Fwhich is why we will work with areas to
OL,11,Fmake sure city status is preserved
OL,12,Ffollowing reorganisation."
